{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Office After Hours is a frightening and sometimes humorous spot the difference anomaly game with a mysterious story.</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You just want to go home. Why are you still here?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your boss has insisted on extra overtime and now you're stuck in the office after work. Keep an eye out for strange occurrences and you might find your way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265400/extras/OfficeLoopNew-ezgif.com-speed.gif?t=1745315217\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Spot anomalies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During your shift, the office will change and you will discover a lot of work, coffee and, if you are lucky, the office pet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265400/extras/DinoAnomalyGif-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745315217\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Escape the overwork hell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To escape from Endless Solutions, you must find clues that will give you access to new areas and reveal new secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you find all the numbers and collect the story-related items?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265400/extras/CluesGif-ezgif.com-speed.gif?t=1745315217\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Can you escape the demo?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">11 Anomalies  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Working hours</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15-20 minutes (+overtime)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265400/extras/WishlistNo